 hour officials in  New Jersey and New York have banned  swimming and surfing at their beaches  while Dorian makes its way to Canada  the National Weather Service predicts  ocean swells as large as 10 feet but  some locals are not as worried I mean  it's been a conflict because most  surfers are waiting for hurricanes Bob  lifeguards and law enforcement are  expected to patrol those beaches to  enforce that ban and there is a coastal  flood warning for DC Maryland and  Virginia until further notice Dana Omar  that shot when we saw you when we  started just chillingly beautiful if you  think about it with all that destruction  left behind thank you for the report  absolutely
 

